# Pygments release 0.1.3

## Root cause

The CSV and TSV entry points are merged, but consumers cannot require them from PyPI until a new package version is prepared and dispatched.

## Change

Cut the next patch version across both version fields and document every merge since 0.1.2 in the changelog. Prepare an unpublished GitHub draft release from the merged commit.

## Scope

This records the package state at a release boundary. It does not alter the lexer rules or depend on any particular fence content.
